{"synopsis":"Yong Hwarin, seorang pewaris Klan Tianzhong yang memiliki penyakit, akhirnya menyerah pada jalan seni bela diri dan hidup sebagai pedagang setelah menikah dengan keluarga lain.\n\nMembawa penyesalan hingga saat-saat terakhirnya, secara tak terduga dia melakukan regresi ke masa lalu yang dia pikir tidak akan pernah dia temui lagi...!\n\nKembali ke masa-masa di mana dia berada di titik terendahnya, dia bersmpah dalam hatinya jika takdir baru akan terlahir kembali melalui tangannya sendiri.","alternative_title":"천중용문","author":"Gunju","artist":"Mukji","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"03992cde-a10a-420a-bd29-28d05cc19fa1","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"SEASON 1 END","date":"2026-04-30","released":"2026-04-30"},{"chapter_id":"d102588b-96ee-4166-abe2-3caff8b1c7db","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2026-04-30","released":"2026-04-30"},{"chapter_id":"d4c9f25a-651f-4ba5-8e83-a6dc8eaeefd5","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-04-23","released":"2026-04-23"},{"chapter_id":"90f410af-561d-4fd5-94d3-c3bd6457d0af","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-04-22","released":"2026-04-22"},{"chapter_id":"e2d1f4bf-b6f8-4a8c-9f03-cb09befef8e3","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-03-24","released":"2026-03-24"},{"chapter_id":"be72bc63-e594-4bd4-915c-ceed2bdbbd15","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-03-16","released":"2026-03-16"},{"chapter_id":"e2da4475-cfae-43f0-9630-3451fbce7ca8","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-03-16","released":"2026-03-16"},{"chapter_id":"79a53872-3da9-4c2f-b334-b462c452497a","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-02-26","released":"2026-02-26"},{"chapter_id":"16fd056c-cba9-4dab-8884-a56cdb9f5a6f","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-02-26","released":"2026-02-26"},{"chapter_id":"0c97e31f-4d4b-48fd-829f-4906f4445504","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-02-18","released":"2026-02-18"},{"chapter_id":"f5b8dd7a-89b0